{"schema_version": "session-feedback-v1", "timestamp": "2026-08-18T12:00:00", "episode_id": "ALL", "reviewer": "系统 (YouTube 学习总结)", "source": "youtube_learning:Clean_Cut_Audio_01:09-03:36", "kind": "crossfade_preserves_consonant_onset", "candidate_pattern": {"context": "AB_clip_splice"}, "verdict": "policy", "note": "YouTube § 2 (Clean Cut Audio): 不在辅音刚开始位置硬切, 要**保留一部分辅音起音放进 crossfade**. 单纯删除 filler 会把相邻词挤得不自然. 中文的爆破音/送气音起音尤其明显.", "action_taken": "AB_clip 边界向外扩 30-50ms 保留起音 · 放进 crossfade overlap 区"}
