{"schema_version": "session-feedback-v1", "timestamp": "2026-08-18T12:00:00", "episode_id": "ALL", "reviewer": "系统 (YouTube 学习总结)", "source": "youtube_learning:Randy_Rektor_00:38-04:50", "kind": "room_tone_from_same_recording", "candidate_pattern": {"context": "AB_clip_splice_pause"}, "verdict": "policy", "note": "YouTube § 5 (Randy Rektor): room tone 定义为实际空间的噪声底. 硬删除和淡化后仍可能听到'空间消失'. 必须从**同一原始轨、同一会话、同一录制条件**提取干净静段. 不用另一支麦克风、外部素材或降噪后的'无声'.", "action_taken": "room tone 从 raw 三轨对应轨提取(不用 automix), 距离剪切点 <30s, RMS <-40dBFS, 无 ASR word overlap"}
{"schema_version": "session-feedback-v1", "timestamp": "2026-08-18T12:00:00", "episode_id": "ALL", "reviewer": "系统 (YouTube 学习总结)", "source": "youtube_learning:Incidence_14:32-23:21", "kind": "mp3_peak_verify_after_encode", "candidate_pattern": {"context": "final_mp3_qc"}, "verdict": "policy", "note": "YouTube § 3 (Incidence Studio): MP3 编码后重建峰值可能高于源 WAV. 必须对完整 MP3 解码后重新记录 LUFS/LRA/TP/时长/采样率/声道/码率, 不能以 WAV QC 代替.", "action_taken": "loudness_report.json 里 measure_after=post_mp3_encoding · true_peak_dbfs 从 mp3 重测"}
{"schema_version": "session-feedback-v1", "timestamp": "2026-08-18T12:00:00", "episode_id": "ALL", "reviewer": "系统 (YouTube 学习总结)", "source": "youtube_learning:REAPER_00:59-07:41", "kind": "ripple_delete_all_tracks_sync", "candidate_pattern": {"context": "EDL_cut"}, "verdict": "policy", "note": "YouTube § 4 (REAPER Blog): 改变节目时长的删除必须**同步作用于所有轨**(global_ripple_delete). 单轨 gain/mute/bleed 只能是 track_local_operation, 不得改变长度. 错误的 ripple 范围会让访谈轨失同步.", "action_taken": "render_sync_cuts 全轨同步; source_track_gate 只 mute 不改长度 (candidate_family_adapter cough_like 已实现)"}
{"schema_version": "session-feedback-v1", "timestamp": "2026-08-18T12:00:00", "episode_id": "ALL", "reviewer": "系统 (YouTube 学习总结)", "source": "youtube_learning:Curtis_Judd_01:32-08:29", "kind": "sync_check_start_and_drift_separately", "candidate_pattern": {"context": "input_check"}, "verdict": "policy", "note": "YouTube § 1 (Curtis Judd): 时间码只能对齐起点. 长录音末尾仍可能漂移. 同步检查必须分开: (1) offset (起点偏移) (2) clock drift (漂移). 只对齐开头不算全程同步.", "action_taken": "input_manifest 分开记 offset_samples + drift_ppm; 拒绝在多窗口不达标时自动校正"}
