{"schema_version":"session-feedback-v1","timestamp":"2026-08-18T16:00:00","episode_id":"ALL","reviewer":"熊镇正","source":"claude-code-session","kind":"never_eat_neighbor_word","candidate_pattern":{"any":true},"verdict":"forbidden","note":"用户明确 (2026-08-18 16:00): 'c007 的额的前一个词剪辑掉了 · c034 更夸张剪掉了两个词 · 不能剪辑相关的词'. edge_extend 或 crossfade 都不能覆盖到相邻词 (prev/next).","action_taken":"cut_start=max(filler.start-edge, prev_word.end + 20ms), cut_end=min(filler.end+edge, next_word.start - 20ms). chain 场景: cut_end 用 next_kept_word.start - 30ms (librosa onset)."}
